## COMPOUNDING SEQUENCE

1. **Resins & balsams first** — Siam Benzoin 50%, Vietnamese Benzoin 20%, Labdanum 10%, Olibanum 50%
2. **Tobacco & gourmand** — Tobacco Absolute 10%, Coumarin 20%, Vanillin 10%, Hay Absolute 10%
3. **Woods & amber** — Iso E Super, Sandalore, Cedramber, Ebanol, Patchouli, Ambrox Super 33%, Ambrofix 30%, Amberwood F
4. **Musk** — Habanolide, Zenolide, Galaxolide 50%, Exaltolide 10%, Musk Ketone 10%, Tonalide 10%
5. **Floral & bridge** — Hedione, PEA, Alpha Isomethyl Ionone, Nympheal, Hydroxycitronellal, Florol, Mayol, Ultralia
6. **Leather & smoke** — Suederal 10%, Black Agarwood 10%, Safraleine 10%, Guaiacol 10%, Castoreum, Nagarmortha
7. **Citrus & spice last** — Bergamot, Linalool, Linalyl Acetate, Grapefruit, Lavender, Petitgrain, Lemon, Cardamom, Ginger, Pepper
8. **DPG q.s.** to exactly 6,000 µL concentrate
9. **Homogenize** → rest 48h → dilute to 20% in ethanol → mature 14–21 days
